{"about_the_game":"In Dice Up, eating food gives you powers. Eating a large block of food gives you a powerful effect but can only be used once. Dicing up your food into smaller piece allows you to use you power multiple times but at a reduce strength. Determine how to dice up each food to gain the right quantity and strength of powers to reach the exit.<br><br><br>Dice up your food into either big, medium or small pieces. Dicing into smaller pieces will give you more pieces to use but with a weaker effect.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/dicing.gif?t=1721041230\" /><br><br><br>Eat food to gain powers allowing you to better traverse the levels.<br><br>For example:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Eating an onion makes you cry. You can run on your tears to move faster. Running on the tears from a small chunk of onion will give you a small speed boost.<br></li><li>Eating a medium sized piece of onion will lead to a greater speed boost.<br></li><li>Eating a whole onion will give the maximum speed boost.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/Onion_comparison.gif?t=1721041230\" /><br><br><br>Each world introduces a new mechanic into the levels leading to more complex puzzles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/parachute.gif?t=1721041230\" /><br><br><br>Use Your Resources Wisely to Reach the Exit.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633280/extras/reaching_exit.gif?t=1721041230\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Door darter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2633280/f02798b13b34ec515ae4fc95f17cdb3717e7e5e0.jpg"},{"name":"Conveyor climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app